# Build output. build/ holds the publishable copy scripts/docbuild.wls writes at
# build/WolframPhysics (the paclet skeleton plus the DocumentationBuild pages that
# scripts/publish.wls deploys) and the local site; dist/ holds the packed .paclet archive
# scripts/build_paclet.wls writes.
/build/
/dist/
*.paclet

# Built documentation notebooks: BUILD ARTIFACTS, not tracked. WolframPhysics/Documentation/ (the
# whole built tree: the notebooks under English/Guides, English/Tutorials and
# English/ReferencePages/Symbols, the incremental-build manifest .doc_manifest.wl and the .build_ok
# stamp beside them, and the SearchIndex, SpellIndex and Index directories the Documentation Center
# writes there when it builds the pages in place) and WolframPhysics/ResourceDefinition.nb. They are
# artifacts because scripts/build_notebooks.wls (wrapper: ./build_docs.sh) generates every one of
# them from the markdown under docs/en and docs/ResourceDefinition.md, every publish rebuilds them,
# and they are large machine-written notebooks whose diffs carry no review value. The markdown is
# the source of truth; the notebooks are produced by scripts/build_notebooks.wls and consumed, after
# a build, by scripts/docbuild.wls, scripts/publish.wls, scripts/build_site.wls and
# scripts/build_paclet.wls, none of which runs on a tree the build has not written: docbuild and
# build_paclet require every page to be present and current with docs/en (wpRequireBuiltDocs in
# scripts/deploy_common.wls), and publish and build_site stop on the notebooks they do not find.
# Ignored with them: the input-only notebooks of a structure build (./build_docs.sh structure)
# under docs/en/.generated.
/WolframPhysics/Documentation/
/WolframPhysics/ResourceDefinition.nb
/docs/en/.generated/

# Python bytecode from the tools/dev gates
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local secrets for CI and the Prime-orchestrated build (scripts/sync_ci_secrets.sh,
# scripts/prime_ci.sh) - NEVER commit these
/.env
/.secrets
/.mathpass

# Claude Code local state: session worktrees and the optional .claude/skills -> ../.agent-skills
# discovery symlink (the skills themselves are tracked in .agent-skills/)
.claude/

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store

# Other agent harnesses' local state, and editor and scratch files
.gemini/
.agent/
.agents/
_agent/
_agents/
*.mx
*.wl.bak
*.tmp
*.swp
*~
